_Bonelord_Cave_2_67c35f.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.80<br/>July 21, 2015<br/>Summer Update 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Vandura Bonelord Cave</b> is located on the western part of the island. It's a good place to farm <a href=\"#/wiki/Bonelord%20Eye\">Bonelord Eyes</a> which are usually very valuable since they are required for a quest.\n</p><p>The teleport on the east side of the second floor (room with <a href=\"#/wiki/Braindeath\">Braindeaths</a>) will send you to a <a href=\"#/wiki/Sacrificial%20Stone\">Sacrificial Stone</a> just by the dungeon's entrance.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>First Floor</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gazer\"><img alt=\"Gazer\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gazer_e1aa99.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Gazer\">Gazer</a></td><td st